<section class="hero" id="compass">
  <div class="wrap hero-grid">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="product">{% include "mark-compass.njk" %} <span>Compass<span class="from">, from ayeo</span></span></p>
      <h1>Enough process for the work at hand. No&nbsp;more.</h1>
      <p class="lede">Spec-driven development gives every change the same process. Changing a label on a website gets the same spec, plan and review as moving to a new payments provider.</p>
      <p class="lede">Compass is an open-source plugin for <a href="https://claude.com/product/claude-code">Claude Code</a>. It assesses each change by risk, familiarity, size and goal, then picks an approach to match: what to write, what to check, and when to ask a human.</p>
      <p class="actions">
        <a class="button" href="#install">Install Compass</a>
        <a class="button quiet" href="{{ site.compass.url }}">Read the code on GitHub</a>
      </p>
      <p class="small facts"><a href="{{ site.compass.url }}/releases/tag/v{{ site.compass.version }}">Compass {{ site.compass.version }}</a>, released {{ site.compass.released }}. Free and open source under the <a href="{{ site.compass.url }}/blob/main/LICENSE">{{ site.compass.licence }} licence</a>.</p>
    </div>
    <figure class="instrument" data-fig="assess">
      <div class="inst-head"><figcaption class="cap">One change, read four ways</figcaption><div class="inst-ctl"><input type="range" id="scrub-assess" min="0" max="1000" value="1000" aria-label="Scrub the animation"><button class="replay" type="button">Replay</button></div></div>
      <svg viewBox="0 0 720 400" role="img" aria-label="Animated: a change is scored on risk, familiarity, size and goal, and the approach Regular is chosen."></svg>
      <p class="inst-note">Illustrative assessment, in the words Compass uses. <code>RP-SHAPE-005</code> is the ID of the policy rule that picks the approach.</p>
    </figure>
  </div>
</section>

